                <h3>SPackageCreator3D - A 3D Content Creator to the Moodle Platform to Support Human Anatomy Teaching and Learning</h3>
                <div class="metadata">
                    <span><strong>Authors:</strong> Baptista, Fabrício Quintanilha and Neto, Mário Popolinand Baglie, Luiz Soares dos Santosand Weber, Silke Anna Theresa and Brega, José Remo Ferreira</span>
