            </div>
            <div class="publication">
                <h3>The role of new technologies in the learning process: Moodle as a teaching tool in Physics</h3>
                <div class="metadata">
                    <span><strong>Authors:</strong> Martín-Blas, Teresaand Serrano-Fernández, Ana</span>
                    <span><strong>Type:</strong> Article</span>
